# ...but everything the website serves must ship: GitHub Pages publishes
# docs/, so renders and anything added later need to be tracked or they
# 404 on the site.
!docs/**/*.webp
# Local only, never on GitHub: the Python build and render tools, and the
# old Workbench project. Anchored to the top folder, so a data/tools folder
# or a script folder called Tools is mod content and stays tracked.
/tools/
/Workbench/
